    "created_at": "2022-10-07T08:44:01Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-10-07T08:44:01Z",
    "body": "I don't feel too strongly about the precise limit. 10000 matches two of the three engines and I've never seen a bug about people requesting more, so I don't think we _need_ to raise it, but I wouldn't be opposed to do so... How strongly do you feel about it @mfreed7?",
