    "updated_at": "2022-10-07T16:29:34Z",
    "body": "Ok as per https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8347#issuecomment-1271667125, raising it to 100000 sounds good to me. @rniwa @smfr @nt1m, would WebKit be fine with raising it?\r\n\r\nIt'd be just adding one zero here: https://searchfox.org/wubkat/rev/e8e9be7353991aee7df45aa62f0e0148f16e6f9f/Source/WebCore/html/HTMLSelectElement.cpp#69",
